OL,3,GNEWSATheatre to close over 'serious
OL,4,Afinancial constraints'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town's theatre will close next month
OL,7,Fbecause of "very serious financial
OL,8,Fconstraints", its chair has said.
OL,10,FThe Brewhouse Theatre in Taunton,
OL,11,FSomerset, has confirmed it will shut on
OL,12,F31 October, though it hopes this will
OL,13,Fbe temporary. All shows after that date
OL,14,Fhave been cancelled.
OL,16,FTaunton Theatre Association, the
OL,17,Fcharity which runs the playhouse,
OL,18,Flaunched an appeal on Saturday asking
OL,19,Fpeople to pledge a donation to save it,
OL,20,Fwhile a separate fundraiser has
OL,21,Fgenerated nearly #10,000.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
