OL,3,GNEWSATheatre to close over 'serious
OL,4,Afinancial constraints'
OL,5,
OL,6,FVal Hammond, the charity's chair, said
OL,7,Fthey had received more than one "big
OL,8,Fpledge", but added they "still have a
OL,9,Fhuge gap to go", with an aim of raising
OL,10,F#150,000 in total.
